Package: quorum
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6 (>= 8), ca-certificates
Recommends: libcuda-12-4 | libcuda-11-8
Maintainer: Quorum <dev@quorum.example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/quorum/Quorum
Description: Quorum — AI Model Router & Orchestration Engine
 Quorum is a self-hosted AI orchestration engine that routes model requests
 across local, cloud, and network providers with policy-based quorum
 verification. It runs as a single binary with an embedded Hermes desktop
 framework for tray-based management.
 .
 Features:
  - Policy-based model routing with quorum verification
  - Local LLM inference via bundled llama-server (supports CUDA, AVX2, CPU)
  - Cloud provider integration (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)
  - Hermes desktop tray integration for zero-ops management
  - Auto-update via Hermes updater channel
  - Zero external dependencies — all bundled in a single executable
 .
 This package installs the Quorum binary and desktop integration.
 An AppImage alternative is also available for portable use.
